{"id":"n33019-1-12","stage":4,"title":"격리 · 隔开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n33019-1-12-1","ko":"이 기숙사는 단독 건물로 되어 있네요.","zh":"这间宿舍是独立的一栋楼呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"기숙사는","meaning":"宿舍","explanation":"기숙사：宿舍；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"기숙사","audio":"/audio/05e9ed6b1689b2f78ab6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18273","senseId":"1","lemma":"기숙사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기숙사는","audio":"/audio/b677d8c875cf5d9b333e.mp3"}},{"text":"단독","meaning":"单独，独自","explanation":"단독：单独，独自","readings":[{"term":"단독","audio":"/audio/14b59b6d0a331c42f80c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28371","senseId":"1","lemma":"단독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단독","audio":"/audio/14b59b6d0a331c42f80c.mp3"}},{"text":"건물로","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건물로","audio":"/audio/b251321415cae49ce32b.mp3"}},{"text":"되어","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되어","audio":"/audio/50e84bc2da43dfbd09ba.mp3"}},{"text":"있네요.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있네요","audio":"/audio/8295ec426f5c730a98e7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"05e9ed6b1689b2f7","term":"기숙사","zh":"宿舍","audio":"/audio/05e9ed6b1689b2f78ab6.mp3","entryId":"18273","definition":"学校或公司提供给学生或员工的可以一起睡觉、用餐的设施。","pronunciation":["기숙싸"]},{"id":"14b59b6d0a331c42","term":"단독","zh":"单独，独自","audio":"/audio/14b59b6d0a331c42f80c.mp3","entryId":"28371","definition":"不一起，一个人。","pronunciation":["단독"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d159e943cd5990b937d1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n33019-1-12-2","ko":"네, 그래서 다른 건물과 격리가 되어 조용해요.","zh":"对，正因如此它与其他楼隔开，所以很安静。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":