52e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]},{"id":"6439112965252b69","term":"격리","zh":"隔开，隔离","audio":"/audio/6439112965252b69632c.mp3","entryId":"33019","definition":"从中间阻拦或分离，使其不能跟其他东西相通。","pronunciation":["경니"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"1cd9dc985df28c49","term":"조용하다","zh":"安静","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3","entryId":"58167","definition":"听不见任何声音。","pronunciation":["조용하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/35952456554ea4dad831.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.862,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=33019","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这间宿舍是独立的一栋楼呢。","对，正因如此它与其他楼隔开，所以很安静。","我弟弟拿到入伍通知了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这间宿舍是独立的一栋楼呢。","对，正因如此它与其他楼隔开，所以很安静。","我弟弟拿到入伍通知了。"],"answer":1}]}
